  resourceName: Chronicles of Uniwia I
  displayName: Chronicles of Uniwia I
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e71992b248a68c640b023a5abc951a9b, type: 3}
  iconBackgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
  description: "Though Uniwia is a youngling of a town, the tales and legends surrounding
    it are many. Thus, I, the great historian Lisa have taken it upon myself to chronicle
    fact and fiction, so that order may emerge, from the sayings of many.\r\n\nThere
    isn't much that can be recovered from those days. The little evidence that exists
    shows that where Uniwia lies now,  there existed a small town called TeiAth.
    It was home to craftsmen, artists and all sorts of people of science. Its downfall
    however, was brewing in the background.\r"
